& [Intent] make the formed CPMS-I03 family implementable in dependency order without merging distinct semantic authorities or allowing parallel workers to collide on shared integration files
  + preserve a small module per responsibility
  + preserve exact ownership and prerequisite identity
  + make every activation transition separately reviewable
  + refuse implementation while current signatures and host gates are absent

