  + CPMS I02C has a completion proof and 24 implemented and 24 verified requirements
  + CPMS I03 base I03A Revision 1 I03B I03C I03D I03E I03E1 I03E2 and I03E3 remain inactive formation or unsigned candidates
  + every I03 implementation count and verification count is zero
  + no I03 satisfaction signature or active implementation phase lock exists
  + a formation package cannot become an implementation prerequisite merely because its prose is complete

